WEBVTT

00:07:58.730 --> 00:08:00.363
and working as a diving coach.

00:08:00.863 --> 00:08:04.597
It also gave me time to concentrate
on my dorkiest hobby,

00:08:04.630 --> 00:08:06.463
performing as a magician.

00:08:06.497 --> 00:08:09.163
I'm still working on my sleight of hand.

00:08:16.263 --> 00:08:19.130
Opening my mind to new identities
opened new doors.

00:08:19.663 --> 00:08:22.430
Research showed me that I enjoyed
creating knowledge,

00:08:22.430 --> 00:08:23.897
not just consuming it.

00:08:24.330 --> 00:08:25.763
Coaching and performing

00:08:25.797 --> 00:08:28.697
helped me see myself as a teacher
and an entertainer.

00:08:29.330 --> 00:08:30.563
If that hadn't happened,